				Time="2011-11-16T12:25:56" />
		</LanguageCell>
		<LanguageCell
			Language="JPN_KANJI">
			<Text>[Name:TrainerName Idx="1" ]『それが　理由で
破壊を　繰り返すの……？</Text>
			<TextModifiedBy
				User="nakatsui:DB5YGPBX"
				Time="2011-11-16T12:25:56" />
